    "detailed_description": "<strong>STORY</strong><br>A primitive person who has no weapons uses enemy body parts to kill enemies for rescuing a mammoth.<br><br><strong>FEATURE</strong><br>I Have No Weapons is a rogue-lite action game with random dungeons. What makes it exciting is that players can kill enemies in 36 creative ways more than just using swords, guns and bombs in a regular action game! Here are 4 of them:<br><br>.Run and make footprints in a circle. It deals damage to the enemies standing inside the circle.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/5f7e4ea551be23ea0c8f7efaf40a972d.poster.avif?t=1654526659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/5f7e4ea551be23ea0c8f7efaf40a972d.webm?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/5f7e4ea551be23ea0c8f7efaf40a972d.mp4?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>.Pull the skin rug out from under enemies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/6cc7de6b7e2bbe9f6297fc0af219bbe9.poster.avif?t=1654526659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/6cc7de6b7e2bbe9f6297fc0af219bbe9.webm?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/6cc7de6b7e2bbe9f6297fc0af219bbe9.mp4?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>.Blow the gut like a party horn <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/10b4e74511a9fcbd9213ac43916c6514.webp?t=1654526659\" /></div> when suddenly appearing behind enemies to scare them half to death.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/e7b7424f6f20dee05b754768801e88f3.poster.avif?t=1654526659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/e7b7424f6f20dee05b754768801e88f3.webm?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/e7b7424f6f20dee05b754768801e88f3.mp4?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>.Spin the enemy's body round and round on a tailbone until the enemy dies of dizziness.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/b86564e6f3adb0a63eaebef90d29ee71.poster.avif?t=1654526659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/b86564e6f3adb0a63eaebef90d29ee71.webm?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/b86564e6f3adb0a63eaebef90d29ee71.mp4?t=1654526659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Want more fun? Try this game!<br><br>Weapons: 36+<br>Enemies: 50<br>Bosses: 4<br>Levels: 4<br>Rooms: 16 * 4<br><br>It is <strong>NOT</strong> a dungeon exploring game.<br><br><strong>NO TEXT</strong><br>My game has no language so that people speaking any language can play it directly!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1680810/extras/3cc94ad7a3da0c27e990fa0f650a4fec.webp?t=1654526659\" /></div><br><br>email: <a href=\"mailto:minisd68@gmail.com\">minisd68@gmail.com</a><br><br>Music by Eric Matyas<br>",
